<title>UK: First USA CCMT details two-tranche dollar bond.</title>
<headline>First USA CCMT details two-tranche dollar bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST USA CREDIT CARD MASTER TRUST</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $650 MLN	COUPON     1ML+14 BP AVE LIFE    7.03</p>
<p>YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE   FRN	     ISS PRICE  PAR	 EXP MAT     17.AUG.04</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     PAY DATE   07.AUG.97 LEGAL MAT   07.APR.07</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    MONTHLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA</p>
<p> NOTES	TRANCHE B IS FOR $58.735 MILLION, PAYS A COUPON OF</p>
<p>1ML</p>
<p>		PLUS 33 BP. FEES TOTAL 40 BP. RATED A2/A. ALL OTHER</p>
<p>		TERMS THE SAME AS TRANCHE A.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
